{"game": "alien-swarm", "language": "english", "appid": 630, "month": "2012-07", "window": 3, "start_date": 1342396800, "end_date": 1343087999, "month_true_total": 121, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-06 00:54:22 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "4297647", "author": {"steamid": "76561198035256547", "personaname": "Hiniature", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198035256547/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 739, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 739, "last_played": 1314255600, "avatar": "d789d878a0da29c2174182a1d5b8ee464137056f"}, "language": "english", "review": "A good fun game that was fun while it lasted....", "timestamp_created": 1343086497, "timestamp_updated": 1343086497, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "4732786", "author": {"steamid": "76561198041243092", "personaname": "XBlades", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198041243092/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 5371, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4938, "last_played": 1778185703, "avatar": "45b93e1abf7639f4f9a936bb880592a219f92bfd"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game is an incredibly awesome co-op topdown shooter. True cooperation is needed to solve the few levels of the main campaign. There are a bunch of achivements, a basic levelup system rewarding you with new guns and equipment aswell as a promotion system that make you go through them many times. And if you are getting tired of the maps shipped with the base game, you may download some of the countless community mods that add new levels, campaigns and maybe modes to this game.\n\nThe shortness of the game and the lack of updates / fixes in the last years made me assume that this game was rather some sort of a demo for the steamworks framework. It does use many features such as achievements, detailed statistics, multiplayer management via the steam community, steam cloud and what else there may be.\n\nBut despite any negative points and little quirks in this game, i highly enjoyed every bit of it and i hope its community never dies.\n\nGameplay time: main campaign ~2 hrs, community campaigns: ∞ hrs\n\nVideo: 9/10\nAudio: 9/10\nMusic: 9/10\nGameplay: 9/10", "timestamp_created": 1343063503, "timestamp_updated": 1385423826, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "4591642", "author": {"steamid": "76561198039487422", "personaname": "OGK", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/criss1595/", "num_games_owned": 159, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 1298, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1194, "last_played": 1439194816, "avatar": "08790f642d97fcf4aa32512df3fd98e38732292a"}, "language": "english", "review": "hmmm i play this game the second time and it is pretty cool", "timestamp_created": 1343061343, "timestamp_updated": 1343061343, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "5643517", "author": {"steamid": "76561198053408348", "personaname": "Ocelot", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/YourN